sequenceDiagram
    participant Student
    participant StudentMFE
    participant RegService
    participant TicketService
    participant Blockchain

    Note over Blockchain: Test Network (Credential Registry)

    Student ->> StudentMFE: Request ticket for attended event
    StudentMFE ->> RegService: Verify attendance and registration
    RegService -->> StudentMFE: Attendance confirmed
    StudentMFE ->> TicketService: Request credential issuance

    activate TicketService
        TicketService ->> TicketService: Generate verifiable credential (JWT/JSON-LD)
        TicketService ->> TicketService: Sign with issuer key
        TicketService ->> Blockchain: Register credential metadata (optional)
        Blockchain -->> TicketService: Tx receipt / registry entry
        TicketService ->> TicketService: Store credential and proof
    deactivate TicketService

    TicketService -->> StudentMFE: Credential + proof returned
    StudentMFE -->> Student: Display and download credential

    Student ->> Blockchain: Third party verifies credential (issuer signature, timestamp)
    Blockchain -->> Student: Valid - no central query needed
